1
00:01:43,890 --> 00:01:47,870
[KING OF COMEDY]

2
00:01:48,390 --> 00:01:50,910
[Episode 5]

3
00:01:51,120 --> 00:01:52,560
Mr. Zhou, Ms. Lin,

4
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:54,440
