11
00:02:04,640 --> 00:02:05,770
We didn't help much.

12
00:02:21,170 --> 00:02:21,770
Look.

13
00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:23,730
What? Did I transfer the wrong amount?

14
00:02:23,730 --> 00:02:25,220
No. Did it increase?

15
00:02:26,560 --> 00:02:27,820
Am I seeing this right?

16
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:30,030
Look.

17
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:32,930
Did it increase?

18
00:02:34,750 --> 00:02:35,810
That's quite fast.

19
00:02:36,220 --> 00:02:37,940
Can't we just not work?

20
00:02:37,970 --> 00:02:38,810
Where to look?

21
00:02:39,280 --> 00:02:40,000
Here.

22
00:02:42,680 --> 00:02:43,280
It went up?

23
00:02:44,150 --> 00:02:45,870
If no one works, how can we progress?

24
00:02:45,870 --> 00:02:47,280
If no one works, how can society develop?

25
00:02:47,280 --> 00:02:50,140
If you don't work,
how can you afford pork head meat?

26
00:02:50,470 --> 00:02:51,370
[Trending Searches]

27
00:02:57,340 --> 00:02:59,770
[Sapo Fishing Village,
the Prototype of King of Comedy]

28
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:06,230
