29
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:12,050
It went up.

30
00:03:49,470 --> 00:03:50,470
It went up, bro.

31
00:04:08,710 --> 00:04:09,400
Wen.

32
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:10,520
Bad news.

33
00:04:10,790 --> 00:04:13,000
They really made this video channel
popular.

34
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:14,980
Then this house won't be demolished,
right?

35
00:04:14,980 --> 00:04:17,510
I didn't expect this old guy
to act so well.

36
00:04:18,750 --> 00:04:20,160
This old guy is a bit of a surprise.

37
00:04:20,160 --> 00:04:20,550
Yeah.

38
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:22,160
Who are you calling an old guy?

39
00:04:22,160 --> 00:04:23,820
Who are you calling an old guy?

40
00:04:23,830 --> 00:04:24,580
Who are you calling an old guy?

41
00:04:24,580 --> 00:04:25,240
No, Junnan!

42
00:04:25,300 --> 00:04:27,070
No, Junnan! Stop hitting him!

43
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:28,630
Silly Qiang didn't mean it.

44
00:04:28,630 --> 00:04:29,960
Sit down first, Junnan.

45
00:04:30,040 --> 00:04:31,370
Sit down first, Junnan.

46
00:04:31,950 --> 00:04:33,720
Well...

47
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:35,880
Things have come to this.

48
00:04:36,560 --> 00:04:38,390
