49
00:04:38,390 --> 00:04:39,920
Mr. Huang is not important.

50
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:41,600
Zhen.

51
00:04:43,040 --> 00:04:43,970
What about Zhen?

52
00:04:44,190 --> 00:04:45,250
Forget about Zhen.

53
00:04:45,480 --> 00:04:46,680
She doesn't belong to you anymore.

54
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:47,360
Why?

55
00:04:48,150 --> 00:04:49,810
Making this channel popular,

56
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:51,500
