57
00:04:51,830 --> 00:04:52,390
Me.

58
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:54,430
What does it have to do with you?

59
00:04:56,480 --> 00:04:57,140
Our old guy.

60
00:04:57,480 --> 00:04:59,830
Your old guy is just a pawn too.

61
00:05:01,210 --> 00:05:02,810
You said it this time, right?

62
00:05:03,680 --> 00:05:04,680
You said it this time, right?

63
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:05,190
It was you just now too.

64
00:05:05,190 --> 00:05:05,560
Who are you calling an old guy?

65
00:05:05,560 --> 00:05:06,190
Come on, Junnan!

66
00:05:06,190 --> 00:05:07,240
Junnan. Junnan!

67
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:10,040
The credit definitely goes to Zhou Ke.

68
00:05:10,270 --> 00:05:11,130
Think about it.

69
00:05:11,160 --> 00:05:12,750
How will Zhen thank Zhou Ke?

70
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:14,240
How?

71
00:05:14,680 --> 00:05:15,810
Give him some money.

72
00:05:16,430 --> 00:05:18,830
