How could she give money?

73
00:05:18,910 --> 00:05:21,390
She will definitely offer herself to him.

74
00:05:24,720 --> 00:05:25,240
No way.

75
00:05:26,160 --> 00:05:27,090
Absolutely not.

76
00:05:27,680 --> 00:05:28,310
Ruin it.

77
00:05:28,830 --> 00:05:29,690
We must ruin it!

78
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:30,400
