79
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:31,990
Demolish. Demolish the whole village!

80
00:05:31,990 --> 00:05:32,650
Tear it down!

81
00:05:32,650 --> 00:05:33,580
That won't work.

82
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:36,480
If it's demolished,
your girl will have nowhere to live.

83
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:38,560
She will definitely go to the city
with Zhou Ke.

84
00:05:38,560 --> 00:05:40,380
