with you.

85
00:05:40,380 --> 00:05:40,909
Well...

86
00:05:41,480 --> 00:05:42,680
Then demolishing is wrong,
and not demolishing is wrong too.

87
00:05:42,680 --> 00:05:44,000
Then what should we do?

88
00:05:44,390 --> 00:05:45,850
Tell me, what should we do?

89
00:05:47,430 --> 00:05:48,630
