90
00:05:53,190 --> 00:05:54,920
Sea!

91
00:05:55,390 --> 00:05:58,120
Tell me what to do!

92
00:05:58,150 --> 00:06:00,270
What should I do?

93
00:06:01,500 --> 00:06:05,800
To celebrate our followers
breaking the 130,000 mark!

94
00:06:06,510 --> 00:06:06,950
Cheers!

95
00:06:06,950 --> 00:06:07,830
Cheers!

96
00:06:07,830 --> 00:06:08,480
Cheers!

97
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:09,160
Bottoms up!

98
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:11,870
Thank you, Mr. Zhou.

99
00:06:12,310 --> 00:06:13,190
If it weren't for Mr. Zhou...

100
00:06:13,190 --> 00:06:13,820
My brother is just awesome!

101
00:06:13,820 --> 00:06:15,350
No, I should thank Ms. Zhen.

102
00:06:15,630 --> 00:06:17,390
If Ms. Zhen hadn't come to us...

103
00:06:17,390 --> 00:06:18,040
Zhen!

104
00:06:18,040 --> 00:06:18,600
Come on!

105
00:06:18,600 --> 00:06:19,720
