112
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:35,240
My sister has had it so hard!

113
00:06:35,240 --> 00:06:35,680
Thank you!

114
00:06:35,680 --> 00:06:37,270
-Thank you, Ms. Lin!
-It was not easy for everyone!

115
00:06:37,270 --> 00:06:38,510
Thank you, Mr. Zhou!

116
00:06:38,510 --> 00:06:39,110
You two...

117
00:06:39,150 --> 00:06:40,950
Stop calling us Mr. and Ms. anymore.

118
00:06:40,950 --> 00:06:43,000
From now on, call me sister,

119
00:06:43,190 --> 00:06:44,630
