137
00:07:18,680 --> 00:07:19,830
can be said to be

138
00:07:24,630 --> 00:07:25,890
"counted on one hand."

139
00:07:25,950 --> 00:07:27,360
"Counted on one hand?"

140
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:29,120
It's called "just around the corner."

141
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:29,920
Around the...

142
00:07:30,190 --> 00:07:31,190
Stop showing off.

143
00:07:31,510 --> 00:07:32,920
Why not use "I wish you a long life

144
00:07:32,920 --> 00:07:34,310
