148
00:07:39,950 --> 00:07:40,720
You can do it.

149
00:07:40,720 --> 00:07:42,040
Gain some happiness.

150
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:44,680
And at the same time, I'll let myself

151
00:07:44,870 --> 00:07:47,040
have a little happiness.

152
00:07:48,190 --> 00:07:49,800
I get it!

153
00:07:50,600 --> 00:07:51,870
The 580 you transferred to her...

154
00:07:51,870 --> 00:07:53,070
Wasn't spent in vain!

155
00:07:53,070 --> 00:07:54,000
The village chief next door...

156
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:55,360
