157
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:01,270
Let's rock.

158
00:08:04,100 --> 00:08:04,830
Ms. Zhen!

159
00:08:05,430 --> 00:08:07,510
Ms. Zhen,
now that our channel is successful,

160
00:08:07,510 --> 00:08:09,430
