163
00:08:12,430 --> 00:08:12,870
Right!

164
00:08:12,950 --> 00:08:14,870
And attract more tourists!

165
00:08:14,870 --> 00:08:15,430
Right!

166
00:08:15,630 --> 00:08:17,390
Then I will be in our village,

167
00:08:17,390 --> 00:08:18,950
