168
00:08:18,950 --> 00:08:19,830
Sell them to the whole world.

169
00:08:19,830 --> 00:08:20,720
Sell them to the whole world!

170
00:08:20,720 --> 00:08:21,360
Go public.

171
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:22,600
And then I'll just stay at home

172
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:24,070
