173
00:08:24,070 --> 00:08:25,510
Very good! Very good!

174
00:08:25,510 --> 00:08:27,240
Very good! Very good!

175
00:08:27,680 --> 00:08:28,190
When the time comes,

176
00:08:28,190 --> 00:08:30,120
