178
00:08:31,270 --> 00:08:31,560
We will!

179
00:08:31,560 --> 00:08:32,600
Definitely!

180
00:08:32,600 --> 00:08:34,200
-Of course.
-If you don't, I'll be mad at you!

181
00:08:34,200 --> 00:08:36,200
When that time comes,
we'll be together and...

182
00:08:36,200 --> 00:08:37,030
counting money, counting money,

183
00:08:37,030 --> 00:08:41,320
counting money, counting money...

184
00:08:41,510 --> 00:08:42,039
Alright!

185
00:08:43,320 --> 00:08:46,390
