205
00:09:20,270 --> 00:09:20,630
Yes.

206
00:09:20,870 --> 00:09:22,390
Not only did I create miracles,

207
00:09:22,390 --> 00:09:24,870
but I also gained a family.

208
00:09:25,750 --> 00:09:26,320
Family.

209
00:09:27,750 --> 00:09:28,550
Shapu Village

210
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:33,340
