and even more beautiful people.

211
00:09:34,030 --> 00:09:37,080
From now on,
we are Shapu people with Shapu souls!

212
00:09:37,080 --> 00:09:37,510
Alright!

213
00:09:37,510 --> 00:09:39,120
We will promote Shapu Village
to the outside world!

214
00:09:39,120 --> 00:09:39,360
Right!

215
00:09:39,360 --> 00:09:40,270
