227
00:10:10,910 --> 00:10:12,270
Our hero,

228
00:10:12,440 --> 00:10:14,270
Mr. Chen Xingwang!

229
00:10:14,270 --> 00:10:15,200
I'll go get him right now!

230
00:10:15,200 --> 00:10:16,320
Don't call him. Don't.

231
00:10:16,320 --> 00:10:16,960
Let's...

232
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:18,670
Let's toast

233
00:10:18,670 --> 00:10:19,910
