234
00:10:19,910 --> 00:10:20,440
Okay!

235
00:10:20,440 --> 00:10:21,240
Over here!

236
00:10:21,420 --> 00:10:22,880
Come on! A toast to Mr. Chen

237
00:10:22,900 --> 00:10:23,690
