254
00:11:05,280 --> 00:11:06,550
I know who it is!

255
00:11:07,480 --> 00:11:08,550
You know?

256
00:11:12,630 --> 00:11:13,600
Chen Junnan!

257
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:15,240
Chen Junnan!

258
00:11:15,360 --> 00:11:16,090
Chen Junnan!

259
00:11:17,150 --> 00:11:17,790
He's not here.

260
00:11:17,790 --> 00:11:18,550
Chen Junnan!

261
00:11:18,630 --> 00:11:19,480
Chen Junnan!

262
00:11:19,480 --> 00:11:20,240
I'm here. What are you doing?

263
00:11:20,240 --> 00:11:21,120
Zhen, you...

264
00:11:21,120 --> 00:11:21,630
Come down.

265
00:11:21,630 --> 00:11:22,230
Come here!

266
00:11:23,600 --> 00:11:24,260
You bad guy!

267
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:25,510
Ke! Ke!

268
00:11:25,510 --> 00:11:27,240
You've done all the bad things.

269
00:11:27,750 --> 00:11:29,390
You've done all the bad things!

270
00:11:29,390 --> 00:11:30,270
You bought followers!

271
00:11:30,270 --> 00:11:31,800
You got our channel banned!

272
00:11:33,390 --> 00:11:34,150
Ke!

273
00:11:34,170 --> 00:11:35,120
What?

274
00:11:35,150 --> 00:11:35,720
What? Banned?

275
00:11:35,720 --> 00:11:36,780
Stop playing dumb!

276
00:11:37,080 --> 00:11:38,150
Do you know how hard it was

277
00:11:38,150 --> 00:11:39,270
