♪ Like a clown who can become ♪

584
00:22:06,030 --> 00:22:07,590
I don't want to go.

585
00:22:08,140 --> 00:22:11,950
♪ The superhero who makes you smile ♪

586
00:22:12,580 --> 00:22:15,620
♪ Oh, time ♪

587
00:22:15,240 --> 00:22:16,750
I don't know
if they will be able to see us.

588
00:22:15,840 --> 00:22:19,510
♪ People who live like clowns ♪

589
00:22:19,970 --> 00:22:22,620
♪ Have long forgotten the dust
on their sleeves ♪

590
00:22:21,510 --> 00:22:23,550
I just hope they can see us

591
00:22:22,940 --> 00:22:28,300
♪ With honest hearts,
we make this world more tender ♪

592
00:22:23,550 --> 00:22:24,830
live happily.

593
00:22:28,470 --> 00:22:32,120
♪ Oh, time ♪

594
00:22:31,550 --> 00:22:32,240
Alright.

595
00:22:32,320 --> 00:22:36,190
♪ We who were once loved by clowns ♪

596
00:22:36,830 --> 00:22:39,220
♪ Can become superheroes too ♪

597
00:22:39,390 --> 00:22:44,670
♪ Saving every inch of sorrow ♪

598
00:22:45,010 --> 00:22:48,650
♪ Oh, time ♪

599
00:22:48,920 --> 00:22:52,760
♪ We who were once loved by clowns ♪

600
00:22:53,210 --> 00:22:55,810
♪ Can become superheroes too ♪

601
00:22:55,870 --> 00:23:01,150
♪ Saving every inch of sorrow ♪

602
00:23:02,390 --> 00:23:07,360
♪ Then the world is whole again ♪

603
00:23:14,480 --> 00:23:15,280
Stop playing.

604
00:23:19,200 --> 00:23:20,790
I have an announcement to make.

605
00:23:20,790 --> 00:23:21,590
Zhen...

606
00:23:22,400 --> 00:23:24,200
will be mine soon.

607
00:23:25,960 --> 00:23:26,820
Is Zhou Ke gone?

608
00:23:26,880 --> 00:23:27,440
He left.

609
00:23:27,440 --> 00:23:29,570
I saw him get in the car with my own eyes.

610
00:23:30,400 --> 00:23:31,330
Listen, you two.

611
00:23:32,070 --> 00:23:33,730
After the demolition is done,

612
00:23:34,030 --> 00:23:35,310
I will propose to Zhen.

613
00:23:35,440 --> 00:23:37,270
We'll get a little love nest in the city,

614
00:23:37,270 --> 00:23:38,400
just the two of us,

615
00:23:38,590 --> 00:23:40,440
and have two chubby boys.

616
00:23:41,160 --> 00:23:43,000
You two will be my groomsmen!

617
00:23:44,000 --> 00:23:45,200
That's great!

618
00:23:45,200 --> 00:23:47,000
Five, six, seven, go!

619
00:23:47,070 --> 00:23:48,960
A traditional little love nest

620
00:23:48,960 --> 00:23:51,030
is one without Zhen.

621
00:23:51,050 --> 00:23:53,530
So dull, so boring.

622
00:23:56,640 --> 00:23:57,240
Mr. Huang.

623
00:23:59,350 --> 00:24:00,720
Hello, Mr. Huang.

624
00:24:00,750 --> 00:24:02,350
How did it go?

625
00:24:02,830 --> 00:24:03,590
Don't worry, Mr. Huang.

626
00:24:03,590 --> 00:24:04,720
It's all settled.

627
00:24:04,720 --> 00:24:05,510
Their channel is banned,

628
00:24:05,510 --> 00:24:06,590
and he is gone.

629
00:24:08,160 --> 00:24:10,400
You're really placing righteousness
above family loyalty.

630
00:24:10,400 --> 00:24:11,130
What family?

631
00:24:11,350 --> 00:24:13,480
No one is closer to me than you,
Mr. Huang.

632
00:24:13,480 --> 00:24:15,000
You are like my own dad.

633
00:24:15,610 --> 00:24:16,680
Don't say that.

634
00:24:17,520 --> 00:24:18,780
But I am quite curious.

635
00:24:18,880 --> 00:24:20,200
How did you manage to get this done

636
00:24:20,200 --> 00:24:21,590
in just one day?

637
00:24:21,960 --> 00:24:22,590
Mr. Huang,

638
00:24:22,790 --> 00:24:24,680
isn't this very simple for me?

639
00:24:25,200 --> 00:24:26,600
As your general manager,

640
00:24:27,110 --> 00:24:29,070
I planned all of this.

641
00:24:29,350 --> 00:24:32,350
Every step is part of my grand plan.

642
00:24:32,350 --> 00:24:35,210
All you need to do
is make your move without regrets.

643
00:24:35,750 --> 00:24:37,350
Alright, rest assured.

644
00:24:37,440 --> 00:24:38,160
Once this is done,

645
00:24:38,160 --> 00:24:40,110
the group
will definitely not treat you poorly.

646
00:24:40,110 --> 00:24:41,030
I think

647
00:24:41,350 --> 00:24:43,920
the position of general manager
suits you perfectly.

648
00:24:43,920 --> 00:24:45,720
Thank you, Mr. Huang. Thank you.

649
00:24:45,960 --> 00:24:47,220
Good night, Mr. Huang.

650
00:24:53,350 --> 00:24:54,070
Brothers,

651
00:24:56,030 --> 00:24:57,400
we're going to be rich.

652
00:24:58,270 --> 00:25:00,110
We are going to be big shots!

653
00:25:15,030 --> 00:25:17,240
Miss, 10 more lamb kidneys!

654
00:25:17,830 --> 00:25:18,550
Okay!

655
00:25:18,550 --> 00:25:19,880
Forget about the lamb kidneys!

656
00:25:19,880 --> 00:25:21,110
Just give us meat tendons!

657
00:25:21,110 --> 00:25:21,510
Okay.

658
00:25:21,510 --> 00:25:23,510
Lamb kidneys causes internal heat.

659
00:25:28,790 --> 00:25:31,830
So what do you think we should do next?

660
00:25:36,680 --> 00:25:37,400
Ke,

661
00:25:37,750 --> 00:25:39,350
I did the math before.

662
00:25:39,830 --> 00:25:42,430
We could make 18,000
after finishing this job.

663
00:25:43,070 --> 00:25:45,350
So I spent 5,000 buying followers.

664
00:25:46,070 --> 00:25:48,200
I figured we'd still have 13,000 left.

665
00:25:49,070 --> 00:25:51,640
Who knew the platform was so strict

666
00:25:52,160 --> 00:25:54,220
and would ban our channel so quickly?

667
00:25:54,270 --> 00:25:55,400
We didn't make a penny

668
00:25:55,400 --> 00:25:57,440
and even had to pay
for our travel expenses.

669
00:25:57,440 --> 00:25:58,960
Do you think
we've been having a run of bad luck lately

670
00:25:58,960 --> 00:25:59,630
or what?

671
00:26:00,480 --> 00:26:02,140
Should we find a place to pray?

672
00:26:04,070 --> 00:26:06,880
I did that for a reason.

673
00:26:09,070 --> 00:26:09,800
The point is,

674
00:26:10,480 --> 00:26:11,440
these past few days,

675
00:26:11,440 --> 00:26:13,200
debt collectors
have been calling me so much

676
00:26:13,200 --> 00:26:14,680
that my phone is about to die.

677
00:26:14,680 --> 00:26:16,030
I didn't even tell you.

678
00:26:17,070 --> 00:26:18,830
Don't you know what kind of person I am?

679
00:26:18,830 --> 00:26:19,920
In my whole life,

680
00:26:19,920 --> 00:26:22,350
when have I ever been involved

681
00:26:22,350 --> 00:26:23,960
in scamming, cheating, or stealing?

682
00:26:23,960 --> 00:26:25,110
When you were three,

683
00:26:25,440 --> 00:26:27,920
you told me that sheep dung was chocolate.

684
00:26:28,160 --> 00:26:30,070
I was just a kid and didn't know better.

685
00:26:30,070 --> 00:26:31,210
When you were seven...

686
00:26:31,210 --> 00:26:32,670
Let's not talk about that.

687
00:26:32,750 --> 00:26:33,440
Two months ago...

688
00:26:33,440 --> 00:26:34,300
That's enough!

689
00:26:35,400 --> 00:26:36,000
Is it done?

690
00:26:36,110 --> 00:26:37,040
It's that guy's.

691
00:26:37,920 --> 00:26:39,200
It's that guy's.

692
00:26:40,930 --> 00:26:42,640
I was wrong. I was wrong.

693
00:26:46,550 --> 00:26:47,150
It's fine.

694
00:26:48,440 --> 00:26:49,440
It's really fine.

695
00:26:50,030 --> 00:26:51,640
So you won't blame me, right?

696
00:26:52,790 --> 00:26:53,640
No.

697
00:26:53,920 --> 00:26:54,960
Why don't you scold me a bit

698
00:26:54,960 --> 00:26:55,880
or hit me a few times?

699
00:26:55,880 --> 00:26:56,550
You're holding it in

700
00:26:56,550 --> 00:26:58,030
instead of letting it out. I feel...

701
00:26:58,030 --> 00:26:58,760
Not worth it.

702
00:26:58,920 --> 00:27:00,400
It scares me.

703
00:27:00,790 --> 00:27:01,720
It's no big deal.

704
00:27:02,590 --> 00:27:03,790
We're all grown up now.

705
00:27:03,790 --> 00:27:04,830
It's just a small matter.

706
00:27:04,830 --> 00:27:05,510
Shouldn't we be

707
00:27:05,510 --> 00:27:07,440
emotionally stable young people?

708
00:27:08,680 --> 00:27:09,350
Adults.

709
00:27:11,440 --> 00:27:12,000
Alright.

710
00:27:12,200 --> 00:27:13,200
I can't blame you.

711
00:27:13,200 --> 00:27:14,400
Really?

712
00:27:16,720 --> 00:27:17,590
It was all your fault!

713
00:27:17,590 --> 00:27:18,590
How could it...

714
00:27:18,590 --> 00:27:20,070
How could it not be your fault?

715
00:27:20,070 --> 00:27:21,800
It was going so well, and you...

716
00:27:21,880 --> 00:27:23,350
I... you... they had...

717
00:27:23,880 --> 00:27:24,810
They went viral.

718
00:27:26,810 --> 00:27:27,720
And you just...

719
00:27:28,000 --> 00:27:29,130
You turned the tide.

720
00:27:29,310 --> 00:27:30,310
What was I doing there?

721
00:27:30,310 --> 00:27:32,640
And what were you doing there?

722
00:27:36,520 --> 00:27:37,580
Big villain.

723
00:27:37,640 --> 00:27:38,270
The seaweed...

724
00:27:38,270 --> 00:27:39,110
That bearded guy.

725
00:27:39,110 --> 00:27:40,030
He's so mean!

726
00:27:41,790 --> 00:27:42,720
And so ugly!

727
00:27:42,960 --> 00:27:43,310
Where...

728
00:27:43,310 --> 00:27:45,030
Where does he get his confidence?

729
00:27:45,030 --> 00:27:47,240
The point is,
he has a terrible personality.

730
00:27:47,240 --> 00:27:48,590
He's so mean, don't you think?

731
00:27:48,590 --> 00:27:49,790
And that Jiahao.

732
00:27:50,350 --> 00:27:52,720
He just wants to be an official.
You can't count on him for anything.

733
00:27:52,720 --> 00:27:53,880
With a brother like that,

734
00:27:53,880 --> 00:27:54,490
his sister...

735
00:27:54,490 --> 00:27:56,310
Oh right, speaking of his sister, Zhen.

736
00:27:56,310 --> 00:27:57,070
She went too far.

737
00:27:57,070 --> 00:27:58,030
Way too far.

738
00:27:59,160 --> 00:28:00,020
Way way too far.

739
00:28:00,160 --> 00:28:01,090
She went too far.

740
00:28:01,400 --> 00:28:02,160
So arrogant.

741
00:28:03,030 --> 00:28:03,830
What?

742
00:28:04,270 --> 00:28:07,470
Just because she's pretty,
she can do whatever she wants?

743
00:28:08,350 --> 00:28:09,880
You know, as a girl,

744
00:28:10,110 --> 00:28:11,790
it hasn't been easy for Zhen.

745
00:28:11,790 --> 00:28:12,200
Right?

746
00:28:12,240 --> 00:28:13,060
Who has it easy?

747
00:28:13,060 --> 00:28:14,260
We meant well, right?

748
00:28:17,680 --> 00:28:19,070
It's too unfair!

749
00:28:20,440 --> 00:28:22,310
It's all up to you!

750
00:28:22,640 --> 00:28:24,750
Let's go!

751
00:28:30,330 --> 00:28:36,220
♪ Memory is like an endless rain ♪

752
00:28:36,800 --> 00:28:40,970
♪ How to hold an umbrella till the end ♪

753
00:28:39,720 --> 00:28:40,780
Don't take photos!

754
00:28:41,340 --> 00:28:44,220
♪ I love you without telling the world ♪

755
00:28:44,510 --> 00:28:47,220
♪ It's funny, actually ♪

756
00:28:47,650 --> 00:28:50,970
♪ At least you have something
on your mind at night ♪

757
00:28:50,990 --> 00:28:54,110
♪ To be alone with me ♪

758
00:28:56,640 --> 00:28:58,590
I love you all!

759
00:28:58,880 --> 00:29:00,200
I love Shapu Village!

760
00:29:00,590 --> 00:29:02,320
Everyone, go to Shapu Village!

761
00:29:05,790 --> 00:29:07,430
[8 hours later]

762
00:29:41,000 --> 00:29:41,550
Sister.

763
00:29:41,950 --> 00:29:43,480
I can't hold on much longer.

764
00:29:44,590 --> 00:29:46,180
What should we do? Should we dig or not?

765
00:29:46,180 --> 00:29:47,580
Hold on a little longer.

766
00:29:48,550 --> 00:29:50,200
How about you break this vehicle?

767
00:29:50,200 --> 00:29:50,720
Right.

768
00:29:51,840 --> 00:29:52,270
No.

769
00:29:52,560 --> 00:29:54,030
This vehicle is more expensive.

770
00:29:54,030 --> 00:29:55,630
We can't afford to pay for it.

771
00:29:56,680 --> 00:29:58,340
Are you two going to dig or not?

772
00:29:58,780 --> 00:29:59,540
Yeah!

773
00:29:59,560 --> 00:30:00,820
Are you digging or not?

774
00:30:01,590 --> 00:30:03,240
If you don't know how to do it,
get out of it!

775
00:30:03,240 --> 00:30:04,350
I do. This thing...

776
00:30:06,790 --> 00:30:07,830
Let me say a few words.

777
00:30:07,830 --> 00:30:08,960
Quiet down now.

778
00:30:11,830 --> 00:30:12,310
Zhen.

779
00:30:13,000 --> 00:30:13,810
Don't come over!

780
00:30:13,810 --> 00:30:15,460
S-Stay away from my sister!

781
00:30:15,720 --> 00:30:16,640
Don't move. Don't move!

782
00:30:16,640 --> 00:30:17,240
Don't touch her!

783
00:30:17,240 --> 00:30:18,070
Don't move.

784
00:30:18,070 --> 00:30:19,200
Don't get physical!

785
00:30:19,640 --> 00:30:20,640
I just want to ask one question.

786
00:30:20,640 --> 00:30:21,380
Ask from there.

787
00:30:21,380 --> 00:30:22,310
I'll stand here.

788
00:30:22,920 --> 00:30:23,270
Here?

789
00:30:23,270 --> 00:30:24,110
Stay away!

790
00:30:24,110 --> 00:30:24,570
Come on!

791
00:30:24,880 --> 00:30:25,630
Don't get physical!

792
00:30:25,630 --> 00:30:26,790
Stand there! Don't get physical!

793
00:30:26,790 --> 00:30:27,480
Speak.

794
00:30:27,480 --> 00:30:28,000
Zhen.

795
00:30:28,790 --> 00:30:29,440
Are you demolishing it or not?

796
00:30:29,440 --> 00:30:30,680
What does it have to do with you?

797
00:30:30,680 --> 00:30:32,010
What do you mean by that?

798
00:30:32,510 --> 00:30:33,510
Didn't we agree?

799
00:30:33,510 --> 00:30:34,680
I gave you 7 days.

800
00:30:34,960 --> 00:30:36,440
Your channel never took off,

801
00:30:36,440 --> 00:30:37,790
and now it's even been banned.

802
00:30:37,790 --> 00:30:38,920
Accept your defeat.

803
00:30:39,170 --> 00:30:39,890
Don't play dirty.

804
00:30:39,890 --> 00:30:40,570
Play dirty?

805
00:30:40,590 --> 00:30:41,750
Who's playing dirty?

806
00:30:41,750 --> 00:30:42,790
We had already achieved the goal

807
00:30:42,790 --> 00:30:44,000
of 100,000 followers.

808
00:30:44,000 --> 00:30:44,720
It was you!

809
00:30:44,720 --> 00:30:45,720
You messed it up!

810
00:30:46,110 --> 00:30:47,440
You bribed our planner,

811
00:30:48,350 --> 00:30:49,920
which caused our channel to be banned!

812
00:30:49,920 --> 00:30:50,200
Right!

813
00:30:50,200 --> 00:30:51,830
That's your planner's own problem.

814
00:30:51,830 --> 00:30:52,750
What does it have to do with me?

815
00:30:52,750 --> 00:30:53,510
Besides,

816
00:30:53,860 --> 00:30:56,020
we didn't say
we couldn't bribe people back then.

817
00:30:56,020 --> 00:30:57,480
Accept your defeat, Zhen.

818
00:30:57,960 --> 00:30:59,200
Come with me to the city.

819
00:30:59,200 --> 00:30:59,750
Our house there has been...

820
00:30:59,750 --> 00:31:00,950
Who's going with you?

821
00:31:00,960 --> 00:31:02,090
We have our own home!

822
00:31:02,350 --> 00:31:03,220
Let me tell you!

823
00:31:03,240 --> 00:31:04,440
I won't listen to you!

824
00:31:04,790 --> 00:31:06,030
I'm going to wait for the chief.

825
00:31:06,030 --> 00:31:06,640
Yes!

826
00:31:07,300 --> 00:31:08,390
You two can wait,

827
00:31:09,160 --> 00:31:11,290
but there are hundreds of people here!

828
00:31:11,400 --> 00:31:12,710
Demolition is a big deal.

829
00:31:12,710 --> 00:31:14,640
It affects hundreds of households.

830
00:31:14,640 --> 00:31:16,240
Don't throw a tantrum, Zhen.

831
00:31:16,440 --> 00:31:18,920
It's exactly because
it affects hundreds of households

832
00:31:18,920 --> 00:31:20,310
that we can't demolish it!

833
00:31:20,310 --> 00:31:22,170
Everyone here watched me grow up!

834
00:31:22,510 --> 00:31:23,400
All of you know

835
00:31:23,400 --> 00:31:24,730
what kind of person I am!

836
00:31:24,750 --> 00:31:26,920
So I hope you can give me another chance!

837
00:31:26,920 --> 00:31:28,100
Give me 3 more days!

838
00:31:28,200 --> 00:31:28,860
Three days!

839
00:31:29,350 --> 00:31:30,720
Give us 3 more days!

840
00:31:30,720 --> 00:31:31,650
I'm begging you!

841
00:31:31,920 --> 00:31:33,070
That's pointless.

842
00:31:33,070 --> 00:31:33,960
With only 3 days,

843
00:31:33,960 --> 00:31:35,360
what can you possibly do?

844
00:31:35,590 --> 00:31:38,030
Besides, that Zhou Ke has already
taken the money and run away.

845
00:31:38,030 --> 00:31:38,960
What can you do?

846
00:31:39,560 --> 00:31:42,750
Get up. Get up.

847
00:31:47,530 --> 00:31:48,460
Get up. Get up.

848
00:31:59,110 --> 00:32:03,590
Get up.

849
00:32:03,790 --> 00:32:05,840
Hurry up!

850
00:32:06,070 --> 00:32:06,750
Excuse me.

851
00:32:08,310 --> 00:32:09,960
You go first.

852
00:32:10,200 --> 00:32:11,030
Sorry. Sorry.

853
00:32:11,590 --> 00:32:12,850
This way. This way, Ke.

854
00:32:14,110 --> 00:32:16,310
What's wrong with giving us 3 more days?

855
00:32:16,460 --> 00:32:17,570
Where did you come from?

856
00:32:17,570 --> 00:32:19,770
How much has Zhen done for this village?

857
00:32:19,960 --> 00:32:21,230
Which lonely old person in this village

858
00:32:21,230 --> 00:32:22,720
hasn't been taken care of by Zhen?

859
00:32:22,720 --> 00:32:23,520
That's right.

860
00:32:24,160 --> 00:32:24,760
Everyone!

861
00:32:24,790 --> 00:32:26,710
Who here hasn't eaten Zhen's fish balls?

862
00:32:26,710 --> 00:32:28,400
