all my clothes are gone.

1152
00:41:22,760 --> 00:41:23,760
Isn't there still one left?

1153
00:41:23,760 --> 00:41:25,150
What I'm wearing inside is...

1154
00:41:25,150 --> 00:41:26,550
A gift from a good friend.

1155
00:41:27,430 --> 00:41:28,160
Sis!

1156
00:41:30,550 --> 00:41:32,110
But I still remember something.

1157
00:41:32,110 --> 00:41:34,030
I remember that in my dream yesterday...

1158
00:41:34,030 --> 00:41:34,480
What?

1159
00:41:35,920 --> 00:41:36,960
I dreamed

1160
00:41:37,320 --> 00:41:38,980
we went back to Shapu Village.

1161
00:41:39,320 --> 00:41:41,840
Single-handedly, I kept their houses

1162
00:41:42,150 --> 00:41:43,110
from being demolished

1163
00:41:43,110 --> 00:41:44,110
and fixed them up.

1164
00:41:44,280 --> 00:41:45,880
I work in this shipyard.

1165
00:41:45,970 --> 00:41:47,380
He came right in,

1166
00:41:47,410 --> 00:41:48,920
slipped right into the wheel,

1167
00:41:48,920 --> 00:41:50,320
and then went up!

1168
00:41:50,400 --> 00:41:52,400
Then he started singing inside.

1169
00:41:52,400 --> 00:41:53,800
And he danced quite professionally.

1170
00:41:53,800 --> 00:41:56,130
I think he graduated from a dance academy.

1171
00:41:58,670 --> 00:42:01,070
Dreams are always the opposite of reality.

1172
00:42:02,920 --> 00:42:04,190
What should we do

1173
00:42:04,880 --> 00:42:05,510
about the money?

1174
00:42:05,510 --> 00:42:07,000
We didn't earn a single cent.

1175
00:42:07,000 --> 00:42:08,890
Can you talk to them

1176
00:42:09,550 --> 00:42:11,550
and ask for an extension on the debt?

1177
00:42:12,940 --> 00:42:13,820
We even spent all our travel money.

1178
00:42:13,820 --> 00:42:15,530
How about we find some odd jobs here?

1179
00:42:15,530 --> 00:42:16,930
How about you ask around?

1180
00:42:17,030 --> 00:42:18,630
I'm just afraid the locals

1181
00:42:18,630 --> 00:42:20,480
won't hire outsiders for these things.

1182
00:42:20,480 --> 00:42:21,710
Didn't Shapu Village hire us?

1183
00:42:21,710 --> 00:42:24,170
I'm afraid the locals
won't hire outsiders.

1184
00:42:27,710 --> 00:42:29,040
What are you looking at?

1185
00:42:30,670 --> 00:42:31,000
Don't look.

1186
00:42:31,000 --> 00:42:31,480
What's wrong?

1187
00:42:31,480 --> 00:42:31,920
Come on.

1188
00:42:31,920 --> 00:42:32,510
Ke, don't look.

1189
00:42:32,510 --> 00:42:32,840
What's wrong?

1190
00:42:32,840 --> 00:42:33,440
Don't block me!
